// Rule of thumb in MongoDB

// ✅ Embed (inside user) when:

// small data
// rare updates
// always fetched together

// ✅ Separate collection + reference when:

// large data
// many records
// frequent CRUD
// one-to-many relation

// For Todo app, 
// separate task collection is the better design. 
// It scales better and the code stays simpler as features grow.